---
import Card from '@/dashboard/components/ui/Card.astro'
import ConcentrationCard from '@/dashboard/components/calibration-lab/ConcentrationCard.astro'
---

<Card title='Curva de Calibración de Color' eyebrow='3 puntos' right='UNIDAD: CIELAB (D65/10°)'>
  {/* Data provenance — drives the `calibration_source` flag. Real
      colorimeter readings should be marked "Medido"; the exponential
      estimator output is "Estimado" and shows a warning badge in the UI. */}
  <div class='mb-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-3 ring-1 ring-slate-100'>
    <div class='ch-label'>Origen de los datos</div>
    <div class='flex flex-wrap gap-2'>
      <label class='inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 has-[:checked]:border-blue-500 has-[:checked]:bg-blue-50 has-[:checked]:text-blue-700'>
        <input type='radio' name='calibration-source' value='measured' checked class='accent-blue-600' />
        Medido (colorímetro)
      </label>
      <label class='inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 has-[:checked]:border-amber-500 has-[:checked]:bg-amber-50 has-[:checked]:text-amber-700'>
        <input type='radio' name='calibration-source' value='estimated' class='accent-amber-600' />
        Estimado
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class='space-y-4'>
    <ConcentrationCard idPrefix='calib-05' defaultPct={0.5} tag='Carga Estándar' tagVariant='standard' />
    <ConcentrationCard idPrefix='calib-10' defaultPct={1.0} />
    <ConcentrationCard idPrefix='calib-20' defaultPct={2.0} tag='Carga de Saturación' tagVariant='saturation' />
  </div>

  <div class='mt-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 p-4 ring-1 ring-sky-100'>
    <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
      <svg
        xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
        viewBox='0 0 24 24'
        fill='none'
        stroke='currentColor'
        stroke-width='2'
        stroke-linecap='round'
        stroke-linejoin='round'
        class='mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-sky-600'
      >
        <circle cx='12' cy='12' r='10'></circle>
        <line x1='12' y1='16' x2='12' y2='12'></line>
        <line x1='12' y1='8' x2='12.01' y2='8'></line>
      </svg>
      <p class='text-xs italic text-sky-800'>
        Las cargas son editables: midí al colorímetro sobre <b>fondo blanco opaco</b> y anotá la concentración real de cada chip (ej. 0.1 / 0.25 / 0.5%). Ingresá el Lab medido de al menos <b>uno</b> de los tres puntos y, si querés, usá <b>Estimar faltantes</b> para completar los demás. Marca <b>Medido</b> cuando las lecturas vengan del colorímetro.
      </p>
    </div>
    <button
      type='button'
      data-estimate-curve
      class='flex-shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-sky-600 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-sky-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 focus:ring-offset-1'
    >
      Estimar faltantes
    </button>
  </div>
</Card>
